PublicRemarks:
Welcome to this sunny loft-like residence with soaring 10’ ceilings and a private balcony in the heart of Williamsburg! 

Enjoy a refined living experience in this sought-after, full-service luxury condominium. Awarded for its exceptional design and construction, it offers rare peace and privacy thanks to thick walls and concrete slab flooring that provide outstanding sound insulation between units, floors, and from the outside.

With its east-south exposure and oversized, triple-pane Traco windows, the apartment is flooded with sunlight throughout the day—casting warm natural light across wide-plank white oak hardwood floors and filling the space with an uplifting, airy energy. 

Step outside onto your private balcony—perfect for growing sun-loving plants, enjoying morning coffee or dinners al fresco, and soaking in serene treetop views that offer a park-like ambiance.

The professionally designed chef’s kitchen boasts PentalQuartz stone countertops, custom walnut shaker cabinetry with soft-close features, and a stylish tile backsplash. You’ll enjoy a premium appliance suite, including a generously sized Fisher & Paykel refrigerator, a full-size Bosch dishwasher, and a Bertazzoni gas range. The kitchen is also fully vented for serious cooking.

The spa-inspired bathroom has been thoughtfully curated with a soothing palette, Carrera marble mosaic tilework, a custom vanity, chrome Grohe fixtures, and a deep soaking tub—a luxurious setting for unwinding at the end of the day.

