Location:
Set in one of Williamsburg’s most vibrant areas, this condo is just two blocks from the Graham Avenue L train, making Manhattan accessible in only 10 minutes. You’ll be steps away from the iconic restaurants Williamsburg is known for, as well as charming coffee shops, popular bars, multiple grocery stores, boutiques, and specialty shops. Cooper Park—with its tennis courts, skate park, basketball and volleyball courts—is only one block away, offering even more outdoor enjoyment.

